                        "description": "Owner only.\n\n`buffer_minutes` is turnaround time: it blocks the diary after the appointment, is not shown to the customer, and is not billed.\n\n`keywords` is what customers actually type. They ask for a haircut; the service is called \"Cut & finish\". Without the bridge, the booking assistant cannot match them.",
