                        "description": "**No account required.** Making a customer register before they can make an appointment is the easiest way to lose the appointment.\n\n`starts_at` is an ISO-8601 instant \u2014 paste one straight from an availability response.\n\n**409 `slot_unavailable`** means somebody else took it first. Refresh availability and offer another time; this is a normal outcome, not an error. Send this request twice to see it.",
